\\/li>\\n<li>Dubai Creek Harbour<\\/li>\\n<li>Dubai Hills Estate<\\/li>\\n<li>Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)<\\/li>\\n<li>Dubai South<\\/li>\\n<li>Palm Jumeirah<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h2>Leading Off-Plan Developers in Dubai<\\/h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Emaar<\\/li>\\n<li>DAMAC<\\/li>\\n<li>Sobha<\\/li>\\n<li>Binghatti<\\/li>\\n<li>Nakheel<\\/li>\\n<li>Danube<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>","backgroundImage":null},"reviews":{"heading":"What Our Clients Say","tagline":"FROM CLIENT TESTIMONIALS","introText":"Verified experiences from global investors and residents who achieved their real estate goals with FS Advisory.","items":[{"id":"1","name":"Omer Khan","role":"Verified Client","content":"I was looking at the real estate market of Dubai and got in contact with Ms. Hana Taghdis of FS Advisory. She showed me multiple projects and finally I was able to select a unit of my choice.","rating":5},{"id":"2","name":"Nathalie Syvak","role":"Verified Client","content":"Our real estate agent is Yulia Kravchenko, we are very pleased with her work and I would like to note her approach to the client.","rating":5},{"id":"3","name":"Mike Mike","role":"Verified Client","content":"Ultimate admiration! I wanted to know more about the real estate business in Dubai. God sent me a unique intelligent young lady Yulia Kravchenko.","rating":5}],"detailHtml":"<h2>What Our <span style=\\"color:#BFA16A\\">Clients Say<\\/span><\\/h2><p>Verified experiences from global investors and residents.<\\/p>","backgroundImage":"\\/thevalley.png"},"faqs":{"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","tagline":"UAE off-plan property \\u00b7 Buyer guide","mainHeading":"Everything you need to know about UAE off-plan property","contentText":"Answers To The Questions We Hear Most From People Exploring An Off-Plan Purchase In The UAE \\u2014 From How The Process Works To Ownership, Payment Plans, And What To Check Before You Commit.","items":[{"id":"faq-1","question":"Can foreigners buy property in Dubai?","answer":"Yes! Foreign investors can buy off plan properties in Dubai or ready homes in designated freehold areas, making it one of the most open real estate markets globally."},{"id":"faq-2","question":"What\'s the difference between freehold and leasehold property?","answer":"Freehold means you own the property and the land it\'s built on. Leasehold, on the other hand, gives ownership for a set period for usually 99 years."},{"id":"faq-3","question":"How do I start investing in Dubai real estate?","answer":"The best way to invest in Dubai real estate is by connecting with a trusted real estate agency in Dubai that guides you through legalities, developers, and project selection."},{"id":"faq-4","question":"What documents do I need to buy property in Dubai?","answer":"All you need is a valid passport, proof of funds, and a signed sales agreement. And if you are financing, your bank will provide additional requirements."},{"id":"faq-5","question":"Are there additional costs when buying a property?","answer":"Yes, buyers should account for DLD fees (4%), agent commission, and trustee fees depending on whether the property is off-plan or ready."},{"id":"faq-6","question":"What Does \\"Off-Plan\\" Actually Mean?","answer":"Off-plan property is real estate purchased before it is fully constructed. Buyers invest directly from developers at launch pricing with structured milestone-based installment plans."}],"detailHtml":null,"backgroundImage":"\\/buy_hero.png"},"assessment":{"heading":"What is your primary goal?123","tagline":"AI ENGINE ASSESSMENT","subheading":"This helps us tailor recommendations to what matters most to you.12","detailHtml":"<h2>What is your <span style=\\"color:#BFA16A\\">primary goal?<\\/span><\\/h2><p>This helps us tailor recommendations to what matters most to you.<\\/p>","backgroundImage":"\\/ai_engine_hero.jpg","goals":[{"id":"family-home","title":"Family Home123","subtitle":"Find The Perfect Place To Put Down Roots","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"roun