nit.<\\/strong> Pay a booking fee and sign the developer\'s reservation form to secure your chosen unit.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Sign the Sales &amp; Purchase Agreement (SPA).<\\/strong> Formalise the purchase and pay the initial down payment, usually between 10% and 20% of the property value.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Register with the Dubai Land Department.<\\/strong> Pay the applicable registration fee and receive your Oqood, the interim title document confirming your ownership during the off-plan period.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Complete the payment plan and take handover.<\\/strong> Continue instalment payments through the construction period, then receive the finished unit along with the full title deed upon completion.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\\n<h2>Off-Plan vs. Ready Property in Dubai<\\/h2>\\n<p>Both off-plan and ready properties have a place in a well-balanced investment strategy, and the right choice depends largely on an investor\'s goals and timeline.<\\/p>\\n<p>A ready property generates rental income immediately and allows buyers to inspect the exact unit before purchase, but it typically requires a larger upfront payment and comes at a higher overall price point. An off-plan property, by contrast, trades that immediate income for a lower entry cost, a longer and more manageable payment schedule, and the opportunity for the property\'s value to appreciate before the buyer even takes possession.<\\/p>\\n<p>Many experienced investors in Dubai use both strategies in tandem \\u2014 allocating capital to off-plan projects to build a growing portfolio over time, while relying on ready units to maintain steady rental cash flow. We encourage you to browse our full range of off-plan projects to compare current prices, developers, and payment structures side by side.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>Popular Off-Plan Areas in Dubai<\\/h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Dubai Marina<\\/li>\\n<li>Business Bay<\\/li>\\n<li>Downtown Dubai<\\/li>\\n<li>Dubai Creek Harbour<\\/li>\\n<li>Dubai Hills Estate<\\/li>\\n<li>Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)<\\/li>\\n<li>Dubai South<\\/li>\\n<li>Palm Jumeirah<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h2>Leading Off-Plan Developers in Dubai<\\/h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Emaar<\\/li>\\n<li>DAMAC<\\/li>\\n<li>Sobha<\\/li>\\n<li>Binghatti<\\/li>\\n<li>Nakheel<\\/li>\\n<li>Danube<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>","backgroundImage":null},"reviews":{"heading":"What Our Clients Say","tagline":"FROM CLIENT TESTIMONIALS","introText":"Verified experiences from global investors and residents who achieved their real estate goals with FS Advisory.","items":[{"id":"1","name":"Omer Khan","role":"Verified Client","content":"I was looking at the real estate market of Dubai and got in contact with Ms. Hana Taghdis of FS Advisory. She showed me multiple projects and finally I was able to select a unit of my choice.","rating":1},{"id":"2","name":"Nathalie Syvak","role":"Verified Client","content":"Our real estate agent is Yulia Kravchenko, we are very pleased with her work and I would like to note her approach to the client.","rating":3},{"id":"3","name":"Mike Mike","role":"Verified Client","content":"Ultimate admiration! I wanted to know more about the real estate business in Dubai. God sent me a unique intelligent young lady Yulia Kravchenko.","rating":3}],"detailHtml":"<h2>What Our <span style=\\"color:#BFA16A\\">Clients Say<\\/span><\\/h2><p>Verified experiences from global investors and residents.<\\/p>","backgroundImage":"\\/thevalley.png"},"faqs":{"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","tagline":"UAE off-plan property \\u00b7 Buyer guide","mainHeading":"Everything you need to know about UAE off-plan property","contentText":"Answers To The Questions We Hear Most From People Exploring An Off-Plan Purchase In The UAE \\u2014 From How The Process Works To Ownership, Payment Plans, And What To Check Before You Commit.","items":[{"id":"faq-1","question":"What Does \\"Off-Plan\\" Actually Mean?","answer":"Off-plan property is real estate purchased before it is fully constructed. Buyers invest directly from developers at launch pricing with structured milestone-based installment plans."},{"id":"faq-2","question":"How Do Off-Plan Payment Plans Typically Work?","answer":"Payment plans are structured schedules spread across the construction timeline, typically 10-20% down payment and installments tied to construction milestones."},{"id":"faq-3","question":"Can An Off-Plan Purchase Qualify Me For A UAE Residency Visa?","answer":"Yes, investing in UAE property valued at AED 750,000+ can qualify you for an investor visa, while AED 2M+ qualifies for the 10-year UAE Golden Visa."},{"id":"faq-4","question":"How Are Off-Plan Buyer Payments Protected?","answer":"In Dubai, all buyer funds are deposited into government-regulated RERA escrow accounts released only against verified construction progress."}],"detailHtml":null,"backgroundImage":"\\/buy_hero.png"},"assessment":{"heading":"What is your primary goal?","tagline":"AI ENGINE ASSESSMENT","subheading":"This helps us tailor recommendations to what matters most to you.","detailHtml":"<h2>What is your <span style=\\"color:#BFA16A\\">primary goal?<\\/span><\\/h2><p>This helps us tailor recommendations to what matters most to you.<\\/p>","backgroundImage":"\\/ai_engine_hero.jpg","goals":[{"id":"family-home","title":"Family Home","subtitle":"Find The Perfect Place To Put Down Roots","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M8.625 12a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0H8.25m4.125 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0h-.375m4.125 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0h-.375M21 12c0 4.556-4.03 8.25-9 8.25a9.764 9.764 0 01-2.555-.337A5.972 5.972 0 015.41 20.97a.75.75 0 01-1.016-.941l.9-2.316A7.95 7.95 0 013 12c0-4.556 4.03-8.25 9-8.25s9 3.694 9 8.25z\\"\\/>"},{"id":"investment","title":"Investment","subtitle":"Build Wealth Through Real Estate","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.307a.5.5 0 00.71 0l7.234-7.234M21 8.25V12m0-3.75h-3.75\\"\\/>"},{"id":"global-clients","title":"Global Clients","subtitle":"Cross-Border Advisory With Local Expertise You Can Trust.","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18z\\"\\/><path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8\\"\\/><path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M11.5 3a17.5 17.5 0 000 18M12.5 3a17.5 17.5 0 010 18\\"\\/>"},{"id":"passive-income","title":"Passive Income","subtitle":"Finding The Right Home In The Right Community.","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M12 6v12m-3-9h4.5a2.25 2.25 0 010 4.5H9.75a2.25 2.25 0 000 4.5H15\\"\\/>"},{"id":"capital-growth","title":"Capital Growth","subtitle":"Building Wealth Through Strategic Real Estate Investments.","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M3 13.25V21h4.5v-7.75H3zm6.75-4.5V21h4.5V8.75h-4.5zm6.75-5.75V21H21V3h-4.5z\\"\\/>"},{"id":"luxury-lifestyle","title":"Luxury Lifestyle","subtitle":"Cross-Border Advisory With Local Expertise You Can Trust.","icon":"<path stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" d=\\"M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75\\"\\/>"}]}}', 'published', '2026-11-10 07:41:47', '2026-11-10 07:41:47');
